WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:05.880
Usually after a football game, a home football game, they would have a band and a little party.

2
00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.080
What did you all wear to these parties and to the games?

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:15.960
You know, you wore a nice skirt and a sweater that matched, if it was cool and . . . you know, you dressed decently.

4
00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.800
You didn’t wear slacks at all.

5
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.800
No pants were allowed.

6
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.300
But you dressed very nicely.

7
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.480
Your colors matched.

8
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.800
You washed your hair and set it.

9
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.420
You know, you took precautions and pride in yourself and you looked nice.

10
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.760
And homecoming was a little dressier.

11
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:41.080
Homecoming called for a suit, heels, and a corsage; a big yellow pom-pom type chrysanthemum with streamers of purple and gold.

12
00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:46.880
And if your boyfriend was really neat, you would have one of those little gold medal footballs tied on your streamer [laughs].

13
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:50.860
You know, the more footballs you had on your streamers, the neater your date was.
